## Key Learnings

### 1. Prompt Structure Matters

A detailed prompt generates higher-quality outputs.

### 2. Constraints Reduce Hallucinations

Explicit rules prevent AI from inventing information.

### 3. ATS Formatting Is Critical

Simple formatting improves ATS parsing.

### 4. Context Improves Accuracy

Providing complete information leads to better resume optimization.

### 5. Better Prompts Produce Better Results

Clear instructions lead to more reliable outputs.

